Monkeys find brothers arrow-covered and breathless --- Sugrīva Vibhīṣaṇa and leaders mourn Rāghavas --- Vibhīṣaṇa spots hidden Indrajit by māyā --- Indrajit boasts brothers slain beyond rescue --- Rākṣasas rejoice and worship Indrajit --- Indrajit enters Laṅkā proclaiming victory --- Fear grips Sugrīva at arrow-covered bodies --- Vibhīṣaṇa consoles Sugrīva and rallies troops --- Rāvaṇa embraces son and sheds Rāma fever